# Neo4j Patterns

## Performance

- Install `neo4j-rust-ext` for 3-10x speedup
- Always specify target database in queries
- Use query parameters (not string formatting)
- Use `session.execute_read/write` for lazy streaming

## Connection Management

- Set `max_connection_pool_size` appropriately
- Always use `with driver.session(...) as session`
- Use `execute_query` for small/medium; `session.run` for extreme throughput

## Query Patterns

- Profile with `PROFILE` to identify bottlenecks
- Create indexes on frequently queried properties
- Use `UNWIND` for batch operations
- Stream large results lazily

## AI Integration

- Use Neo4j MCP Server for agent graph memory
- Leverage `ai.*` namespace for Cypher-native AI procedures
- Store embeddings and metadata together for hybrid search
